PTX MP+fence.release-release.gpu
"Message passing with fence.release before the flag store and fence.release after the flag load (.gpu)"
{
x=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak x, 1             | ld.relaxed.gpu r0, f     ;
 fence.release.gpu        | fence.release.gpu        ;
 st.relaxed.gpu f, 1      | ld.weak r1, x            ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
